<title>USA: Biodynamics names intl operations head.</title>
<headline>Biodynamics names intl operations head.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biodynamics International Inc said Monday it named Manfred Krueger to head its international operations as managing director of its German subsidiary, Biodynamics International (Deutschland) GmbH.</p>
<p>Biodynamics, which provides bio-implants for tissue repair, said Krueger served previously as executive vice president at Fresenius Critical Care International, a unit of Germany's Fresenius AG.</p>
